## Scoring rules
- Every score must be backed by the "evidence" string; if there is no evidence,
  score 0 and say so.
- Use the maximum of each category only for exceptional, clearly evidenced cases.
- Deductions must have explicit reasons; a deduction is not a negative score.
- Do not speculate about the person beyond what the CV and any GitHub signals show.
- Ignore the candidate's name, gender, age, location, institution name, grades,
  ethnicity, and religion when scoring.
- Output ONLY the JSON object. No prose, no markdown fences.
